BD 200L X ShowError Value for IMBD 200 wrong should be "200" ContB board.L C9 SkipE 400		; Value for IMBD 400L X ShowError Value for IMBD 400 wrong should be "400" ContB board.L C10 SkipE 1000		; Value for IMBD 1000L X ShowError Value for IMBD 1000 wrong should be "1000" ContB board.L C11 SkipE 2000		; Value for IMBD 2000L X ShowError Value for IMBD 2000 wrong should be "2000" ContB board.L C12 SkipE 4000		; Value for IMBD 4000L X ShowError Value for IMBD 4000 wrong should be "4000" ContB board.(1792)\f5b25f0B4857f5b29f0B3528f5b20f0B2199f5b23f0B3770f5b23f0B1197f5b20f0B1180f5b19f0B1155f5b20f0B1791f5b21f0B1404f5b19f0B739f5b18f0B209f5b20f0B20429f5b20f0B800f5b17f0B16f5b17f0B17f5b18f0B15f5b18f0B17f5b17f0B17f5b21f0B17f5b24f0B193f5b25f0B3566f5b28f0B505f5b22f0B6207f5b21f0B44f5b21f0B15f5b22f0B